==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|skemmta||to entertain}} and {{m|is|sér}} the dative of {{m|is|sig||oneself}}.

===Verb===
{{head|is|verb|head=[[skemmta]] [[sig#Icelandic|sér]]}}

# to [[enjoy oneself]], to [[have fun]], (''UK'') to [[have a laugh]]{{jump|is|enjoy oneself|s}}
#: {{ux|is|Heyrðu.. Reyndu allavegana að '''skemmta þér''', okei?|Listen.. At least try to '''have fun''', OK?}}

====Synonyms====
* {{jump|s|is|enjoy oneself}} {{l|is|gleðjast}}

